{"ticker":"ECHO","updated":"2026-10-23T22:54:21Z","profile":{"longName":"EchoStar Corporation","shortName":"EchoStar Corporation","sector":"Communication Services","industry":"Telecom Services","country":"United States","website":"https://www.echostar.com","fullTimeEmployees":12100,"marketCap":25905874944,"trailingPE":null,"forwardPE":5.7957063,"priceToSalesTrailing12Months":1.7678454,"pegRatio":1.33,"targetMeanPrice":130.2,"targetHighPrice":156.0,"targetLowPrice":103.0,"numberOfAnalystOpinions":10,"recommendationKey":"strong_buy","revenueGrowth":-0.04,"earningsGrowth":null,"grossMargins":0.29540002,"operatingMargins":0.14279,"profitMargins":-0.38712,"totalRevenue":14653925376,"beta":0.992,"fiftyTwoWeekHigh":147.25,"fiftyTwoWeekLow":65.76,"currency":"USD","exchange":"NMS","quoteType":"EQUITY","dividendYield":0.0},"summary":"EchoStar Corporation provides pay-tv services in the United States, Mexico, Canada, South and Central America, Asia, Africa, Australia, Europe, India, and the Middle East. The Pay-TV segment offers a direct broadcast and fixed satellite, owned and leased satellites, leased fiber optic networks, in-home services, and call center operation services; digital broadcast operations, including satellite uplinking/downlinking, transmission and, other services to third-party pay-TV providers; multichannel, live-linear and on-demand streaming over-the-top Internet-based domestic, international, Latino, and Freestream video programming services; and receiver systems. Its Wireless segment provides wireless communication services and products; and a range of wireless devices. The Broadband and Satellite Services offers broadband satellite technologies, and internet products and services to consumer customers, including home and small to medium-sized businesses; managed services, equipment, hardware, satellite services, and communications solutions to government and enterprise customers, as well as to the unserved and underserved consumer, enterprise, aeronautical, and government markets; and integrated multi-transport solutions that enable airline and airline service providers to deliver in-flight network connectivity. This segment also designs, provides, and installs gateway and terminal e","summary_zh":"EchoStar Corporation 在美國、墨西哥、加拿大、南美洲和中美洲、亞洲、非洲、澳洲、歐洲、印度和中東提供付費電視服務。付費電視部門提供直播和固定衛星、自有和租賃衛星、租賃光纖網路、家庭服務和呼叫中心營運服務；數位廣播業務，包括衛星上行/下行、傳輸以及向第三方付費電視提供商提供的其他服務；基於互聯網的多頻道、線性直播和點播流媒體頂級互聯網國內、國際、拉丁裔和自由流影片節目服務；和接收系統。其無線部門提供無線通訊服務和產品；以及一系列無線設備。寬頻和衛星服務向消費者客戶（包括家庭和中小型企業）提供寬頻衛星技術以及互聯網產品和服務；為政府和企業客戶以及未獲得服務和服務不足的消費者、企業、航空和政府市場提供託管服務、設備、硬體、衛星服務和通訊解決方案；以及整合的多傳輸解決方案，使航空公司和航空公司服務供應商能夠提供飛行中的網路連線。該部門還設計、提供和安裝網關和終端e","sector_zh":"通訊服務","industry_zh":"電信服務","candles":[{"t":"2025-08-25","o":29.95,"h":30.07,"l":29.34,"c":29.88,"v":2493700},{"t":"2025-08-26","o":54.11,"h":55.19,"l":50.62,"c":50.87,"v":46579100},{"t":"2025-08-27","o":54.31,"h":59.64,"l":53.9,"c":58.76,"v":19724800},{"t":"2025-08-28","o":58.71,"h":58.85,"l":54.74,"c":56.95,"v":8130000},{"t":"2025-08-29","o":57.14,"h":61.87,"l":56.26,"c":61.79,"v":12454800},{"t":"2025-09-02","o":60.94,"h":65.54,"l":60.35,"c":65.24,"v":6894400},{"t":"2025-09-03","o":65.06,"h":65.24,"l":62.28,"c":63.91,"v":4644900},{"t":"2025-09-04","o":64.08,"h":67.36,"l":63.39,"c":67.22,"v":4540300},{"t":"2025-09-05","o":67.13,"h":70.19,"l":66.18,"c":67.24,"v":7061500},{"t":"2025-09-08","o":81.53,"h":84.48,"l":75.5,"c":80.63,"v":24269800},{"t":"2025-09-09","o":83.58,"h":85.37,"l":79.22,"c":83.57,"v":10168100},{"t":"2025-09-10","o":83.5,"h":85.0,"l":79.5,"c":79.89,"v":4721900},{"t":"2025-09-11","o":79.06,"h":79.7,"l":75.0,"c":77.04,"v":7090400},{"t":"2025-09-12","o":77.05,"h":77.27,"l":74.11,"c":74.89,"v":5558100},{"t":"2025-09-15","o":72.11,"h":74.55,"l":70.41,"c":71.94,"v":7512200},{"t":"2025-09-16","o":71.89,"h":72.06,"l":69.14,"c":69.8,"v":5518800},{"t":"2025-09-17","o":69.39,"h":73.58,"l":68.92,"c":71.81,"v":7567900},{"t":"2025-09-18","o":71.99,"h":72.87,"l":70.71,"c":71.22,"v":3994300},{"t":"2025-09-19","o":72.36